# This file contains the register of the identities that appear in the
# revision history. We generate the .mailmap and AUTHORS files from it, so to
# change how a contributor is identified or credited, we change their entry
# here and regenerate both files.
#
# Each manifest describes one contributor. The name and email values are the
# preferred identity. Each alias value is another identity of the same
# contributor in the history, in the 'Name <email>' form. The authors value
# selects the AUTHORS entry: name (the default) lists the preferred name,
# email also lists the email, and none leaves the contributor out (this is
# how we exclude bots).
#
: 1
name: William Roy
email: wroy@proton.me
authors: name
